## Writing rules

- Use exact type names from code (`DynamicBodyAuthoring`, not "Rigidbody Component")
- Pull feature/limitation prose from `doc.txt`; verify against code before publishing
- Document subscene + baking workflow — ECS, not classic MonoBehaviour physics
- Note co-dependencies (`PhysicsVelocityAuthoring` only on dynamic bodies)
- Note warnings from source (velocity ignored on `SurfaceBodyAuthoring`)
- For custom jobs: prefer package job interfaces; use `SimulationDataComponent` physics JobHandle for import/export scheduling
- Replace `_config.yml` / `index.md` placeholders when publishing
- Expand reference material — do not paste `doc.txt` verbatim into published pages

